### generic_equable

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl generic_equable x1 x2 =\n    if length x1 <>.. length x2\n    then false\n    else\n        let rec 루프 i =\n            if i < length x1\n            then index i x1 = index i x2 && 루프 (i + 1)\n            else true\n        루프 0","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl generic_equable x1 x2 =
      if length x1 <>.. length x2
      then false
      else
          let rec 루프 i =
              if i < length x1
              then index i x1 = index i x2 && 루프 (i + 1)
              else true
          루프 0
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

