### init_series

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl init_series start end inc : array_base _ =\n    inl total = conv ((end - start) / inc) + 1\n    am.init total (conv >> (*) inc >> (+) start)\n    |> fun (a x : _ int _) => x","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

