### indexed

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl indexed forall t u {number}. (ar : array_base t) : array_base (u * t) =\n    ((0, a ;[]), (a ar : _ int _))\n    ||> am.fold fun (i, acc) x =>\n        i + 1, acc ++ a ;[i, x]\n    |> snd\n    |> fun (a x : _ int _) => x","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl indexed forall t u {number}. (ar : array_base t) : array_base (u * t) =
      ((0, a ;[]), (a ar : _ int _))
      ||> am.fold fun (i, acc) x =>
          i + 1, acc ++ a ;[i, x]
      |> snd
      |> fun (a x : _ int _) => x
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

