<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test\n///> fsharp\n///> cuda\n///> rust\n///> typescript\n\ninl x : _ i32 _ = a ;[ 1i32; 2; 3 ]\nx |> slice 0 0 |> _assert_eq (a ;[])\nx |> slice 0 1 |> _assert_eq (a ;[ 1 ])\nx |> slice 1 1 |> _assert_eq (a ;[])\nx |> slice 1 2 |> _assert_eq (a ;[ 2 ])\nx |> slice 2 2 |> _assert_eq (a ;[])\nx |> slice 0 2 |> _assert_eq (a ;[ 1; 2 ])","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test
  ///> fsharp
  ///> cuda
  ///> rust
  ///> typescript

  inl x : _ i32 _ = a ;[ 1i32; 2; 3 ]
  x |> slice 0 0 |> _assert_eq (a ;[])
  x |> slice 0 1 |> _assert_eq (a ;[ 1 ])
  x |> slice 1 1 |> _assert_eq (a ;[])
  x |> slice 1 2 |> _assert_eq (a ;[ 2 ])
  x |> slice 2 2 |> _assert_eq (a ;[])
  x |> slice 0 2 |> _assert_eq (a ;[ 1; 2 ])
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

### range

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"union range dim =\n    | Start : dim\n    | End : (() -> dim) -> dim\n\ninl range start end s =\n    inl start, end =\n        inl len () =\n            s |> length |> conv\n        match start, end with\n        | Start start, End fn =>\n            start, fn len\n        | End start_fn, End end_fn =>\n            start_fn len, end_fn len\n    s |> slice (start |> convert.unbox) (end |> convert.unbox)","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  union range dim =
      | Start : dim
      | End : (() -> dim) -> dim

  inl range start end s =
      inl start, end =
          inl len () =
              s |> length |> conv
          match start, end with
          | Start start, End fn =>
              start, fn len
          | End start_fn, End end_fn =>
              start_fn len, end_fn len
      s |> slice (start |> convert.unbox) (end |> convert.unbox)
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

## rust

<!-- livebook:{"break_markdown":true} -->

### vec

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"nominal vec t =\n    `(\n        native_type\n            `($'Vec<`t>')\n            `($'Vec<`t>')\n            \"type Vec<'T> = class end\"\n    )","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  nominal vec t =
      `(
          native_type
              `($'Vec<`t>')
              `($'Vec<`t>')
              "type Vec<'T> = class end"
      )
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

### from_vec

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl from_vec forall dim el. (vec : vec el) : a dim el =\n    backend_switch {\n        Rust = fun () =>\n            // the array takes the vec: a join point's argument is the codegen's copy (see optionm'.map)\n            inl vec = join vec\n            $'Rc::new(RefCell::new(!vec))' : a dim el\n    }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl from_vec forall dim el. (vec : vec el) : a dim el =
      backend_switch {
          Rust = fun () =>
              // the array takes the vec: a join point's argument is the codegen's copy (see optionm'.map)
              inl vec = join vec
              $'Rc::new(RefCell::new(!vec))' : a dim el
      }
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

### from_vec_base

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl from_vec_base forall el. (vec : vec el) : array_base el =\n    backend_switch {\n        Rust = fun () =>\n            // the array takes the vec: a join point's argument is the codegen's copy (see optionm'.map)\n            inl vec = join vec\n            $'Rc::new(RefCell::new(!vec))' : array_base el\n    }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl from_vec_base forall el. (vec : vec el) : array_base el =
      backend_switch {
          Rust = fun () =>
              // the array takes the vec: a join point's argument is the codegen's copy (see optionm'.map)
              inl vec = join vec
              $'Rc::new(RefCell::new(!vec))' : array_base el
      }
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
