### slice_range

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl slice_range forall t dim.\n    (start : range t) (end : range t) (s : slice' t dim) : rust.ref (slice' t dim)\n    =\n    inl len () =\n        s |> slice_length\n    inl start, (end : convert.unativeint) =\n        match start, end with\n        | Start start, End fn => start, (len >> convert.convert) |> fn |> convert.convert\n        | End start_fn, End end_fn =>\n            (len >> convert.convert) |> start_fn, (len >> convert.convert) |> end_fn |> convert.convert\n    match start, end with\n    | start, end when end |> convert.unbox =. len () => !\\($'\"&!s[!start..]\"')\n    | start, end => !\\\\((start, end), $'\"&!s[$0..$1]\"')","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl slice_range forall t dim.
      (start : range t) (end : range t) (s : slice' t dim) : rust.ref (slice' t dim)
      =
      inl len () =
          s |> slice_length
      inl start, (end : convert.unativeint) =
          match start, end with
          | Start start, End fn => start, (len >> convert.convert) |> fn |> convert.convert
          | End start_fn, End end_fn =>
              (len >> convert.convert) |> start_fn, (len >> convert.convert) |> end_fn |> convert.convert
      match start, end with
      | start, end when end |> convert.unbox =. len () => !\($'"&!s[!start..]"')
      | start, end => !\\((start, end), $'"&!s[$0..$1]"')
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
