### distinct

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl distinct forall dim el. (a : a dim el) : a dim el =\n    if rust.is_native ()\n    then\n        // native Rust: order-preserving dedup (as F#'s Array.distinct) by core's structural `=` (codegenRust's unions\n        // derive only `Clone`: no Rust `PartialEq`/`Hash` to dedup by); an int dim, which length/loopw need\n        inl a = $'!a ' : a int el\n        inl r = $'Rc::new(RefCell::new(Vec::with_capacity(!a.borrow().len())))' : a int el\n        loopw.for' {from=0; nearTo=length a} fun i =>\n            inl x = index i a\n            inl n = length r\n            inl s = mut {j=0}\n            loopw.while (fun () => s.j < n && index s.j r <> x) fun () =>\n                s <- {j=s.j + 1}\n            if s.j = n then $'!r.borrow_mut().push(!x)' : ()\n        $'!r ' : a dim el\n    else $'!a |> Array.distinct'","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl distinct forall dim el. (a : a dim el) : a dim el =
      if rust.is_native ()
      then
          // native Rust: order-preserving dedup (as F#'s Array.distinct) by core's structural `=` (codegenRust's unions
          // derive only `Clone`: no Rust `PartialEq`/`Hash` to dedup by); an int dim, which length/loopw need
          inl a = $'!a ' : a int el
          inl r = $'Rc::new(RefCell::new(Vec::with_capacity(!a.borrow().len())))' : a int el
          loopw.for' {from=0; nearTo=length a} fun i =>
              inl x = index i a
              inl n = length r
              inl s = mut {j=0}
              loopw.while (fun () => s.j < n && index s.j r <> x) fun () =>
                  s <- {j=s.j + 1}
              if s.j = n then $'!r.borrow_mut().push(!x)' : ()
          $'!r ' : a dim el
      else $'!a |> Array.distinct'
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

