<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl try_item forall dim el. (i : i32) (a : a dim el) : option el =\n    inl fable () : option el = $'!a |> Array.tryItem !i ' |> optionm'.unbox\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = fable\n        Lua = fable\n        Fsharp = fable\n        Python = fable\n        TypeScript = fable\n        Cpp = fable\n        CppHost = fable\n        Delphi = fable\n        Cuda = fable\n        Rust = fun () =>\n            inl x : optionm'.option' el = $'(if !i < 0 { None } else { !a.borrow().get(!i as usize).cloned() })'\n            x |> optionm'.unbox\n    }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl try_item forall dim el. (i : i32) (a : a dim el) : option el =
      inl fable () : option el = $'!a |> Array.tryItem !i ' |> optionm'.unbox
      backend_switch {
          Gleam = fable
          Lua = fable
          Fsharp = fable
          Python = fable
          TypeScript = fable
          Cpp = fable
          CppHost = fable
          Delphi = fable
          Cuda = fable
          Rust = fun () =>
              inl x : optionm'.option' el = $'(if !i < 0 { None } else { !a.borrow().get(!i as usize).cloned() })'
              x |> optionm'.unbox
      }
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```
